OL,3,GNEWSAOne of James Bulger's killers to
OL,4,Aremain in prison
OL,5,
OL,6,FChild killer Jon Venables will remain
OL,7,Fbehind bars after he told a Parole
OL,8,FBoard panel that he should stay in
OL,9,Fprison.
OL,11,FVenables tortured and murdered
OL,12,Ftwo-year-old James Bulger in 1993 after
OL,13,Fhe and Robert Thompson, both then aged
OL,14,F10, snatched him from a shopping centre
OL,15,Fin Bootle, Merseyside.
OL,17,FVenables told parole staff dealing with
OL,18,Fhis latest review, which took place in
OL,19,Fprivate, that he was not seeking
OL,20,Frelease.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,405,400,260,160,0,100
